Source landscape: The 2023 documentary universe is broad across Kremlin and government programs, presidential addresses, budgets, audits, national projects, statistical reports, military planning, civil-society assessments, and independent human-rights and governance reporting. Russian-language official sources are particularly rich for formal goals, laws, budgets, appointments, and implementation records; international and independent sources add adverse, mixed, and alternative perspectives. Search leads remain uninspected candidates, not evidence. [Presidential address](https://duma.gov.ru/news/56440/), [budget execution review](https://budget.council.gov.ru/activity/legislation/resolutions_law/158432/), [Rosstat annual report](https://rosstat.gov.ru/storage/mediabank/Doklad_23042024.pdf), [Freedom House Russia report](https://freedomhouse.org/country/russia/freedom-world/2023), [HRW Russia report](https://www.hrw.org/world-report/2023/country-chapters/russian-federation).

